OL,3,GNEWSAMum calls for routine strep tests
OL,4,Aduring pregnancies
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mum who tested positive for Group B
OL,7,Fstreptococcus (GBS) during her
OL,8,Fpregnancy has taken her calls to
OL,9,Fintroduce regular screening for the
OL,10,Fbacteria to Downing Street.
OL,12,FLeona Hayes, from Chinnor in
OL,13,FOxfordshire, was diagnosed with the
OL,14,Fcondition when she was 34 weeks
OL,15,Fpregnant following a check for reduced
OL,16,Ffoetal movement.
OL,18,FShe has since launched a campaign to
OL,19,Fintroduce widespread Group B strep
OL,20,Fscreening for pregnant women, and on
OL,21,FWednesday took her mission to
OL,22,FWhitehall.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
