OL,3,GNEWSAMum calls for routine strep tests
OL,4,Aduring pregnancies
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department of Health and Social
OL,7,FCares (DHSC) said it was funding a
OL,8,Ftrial to determine the effectiveness of
OL,9,Froutine testing for GBS for all women.
